WEBVTT

00:02:29.678 --> 00:02:31.764
i nikad ne možete da zapamtite
koja ide gde,

00:02:31.764 --> 00:02:33.141
mislite vino, voda

00:02:33.141 --> 00:02:34.689
v-i, v-o;

00:02:34.689 --> 00:02:35.851
i, o;

00:02:35.851 --> 00:02:39.023
"i" je pre "o" u azbuci.

00:02:39.023 --> 00:02:39.980
Još jedan savet:

00:02:39.980 --> 00:02:42.734
Da biste zapamtili levo-desno
sa hlebom i pićem,

00:02:42.734 --> 00:02:45.052
zapamtite HOV.

00:02:45.052 --> 00:02:47.367
H, vaš hleb, ide levo;

00:02:47.367 --> 00:02:49.156
O, vaš obrok, ide u sredinu;

00:02:49.156 --> 00:02:52.219
i V, vaša voda, ide desno.

00:02:52.219 --> 00:02:55.552
Najzad, salvet tradicionalno ide
s leve strane viljuški,

00:02:55.552 --> 00:02:58.498
iako je u redu staviti ga
i ispod viljuški.

00:02:58.498 --> 00:03:00.416
Za fensi obrok kao ovaj